Builds of tools/vward-core for a run by the owner's command in /tmp: version, probe, dry-run
(read only); recover (reads the router, writes only the local journal); selftest (the first
write: the group VwardTest created, proven, removed, proven; without --yes the plan only);
check-host (one name checked directly and through the VPN, nothing sent); adaptive
(Autopodbor: observation without --apply, names into AdaptiveAuto with it).
Reproducible: build.sh OUT --check must give the sums in ../SHA256SUMS. Not part of the
installation package (not in package-map.tsv).
